1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:11,000
示範申請 OpenRouter API Key 並連接「分帳管家」。
按 Sign up 註冊；已有帳戶就直接登入。
Create an OpenRouter API key and connect Bill Splitter.
Select Sign up, or log in if you have an account.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:21,500
新用戶可在 Sign up 畫面選 Google 圖示，用 Gmail 登記。
New users can choose the Google icon and sign up with Gmail.

3
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:31,600
登入後開啟 API Keys，按 New Key，命名並設定有效期。
Open API Keys, select New Key, name the key, and set expiry.

4
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:41,900
建議有效期選一年，不要選永久。Credit limit 選 Custom amount。
Choose one year, not No expiration. Set Custom amount.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,100
免費模型將額度設為 0，可避免意外收費；再檢查有效期。
For free models, set the limit to zero to avoid unexpected charges.

6
00:00:52,100 --> 00:01:02,200
確認期限和額度後按 Create。新金鑰只完整顯示一次。
Select Create, then copy and store the key securely. It appears once.

7
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:13,400
返回分帳管家設定，選擇標示免費的模型，貼上 API Key。
按「儲存並驗證」，確認連線成功。
Return to Bill Splitter settings and choose a model marked Free.
Paste the API key, select Save & Verify, and confirm the connection.

8
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:20,500
需要在這部裝置記住金鑰時，先選擇保存選項。
金鑰只保存在本機設定，不要傳給朋友。
Choose the save option only if needed on this device.
The key stays in local settings; never send it to friends.
